<title>CANADA: Atlanta Gold halted for Indonesia news.</title>
<headline>Atlanta Gold halted for Indonesia news.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlanta Gold Corp halted its stock on the Toronto Stock Exchange on Wednesday as it prepared to release news on its exploration properties in Indonesia, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>Shares in the Vancouver-based company were halted Wednesday afternoon at C$1.20</p>
<p>A geologist has looked over reports about the company's Indonesian properties and found the reports &quot;positive,&quot; said spokesman Health Ellingham.</p>
<p>A news release is expected on Thursday morning, he said.</p>
<p>-- Heather Scoffield, Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8104</p>
</text>
